{"sourceUrl":"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/b0/56/c43776a700502/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.549754+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/b0/56/c43776a700502/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span>华东师范大学是教育部直属重点大学、国家“</span><span><strong>双一流</strong></span><span>”、“</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>211</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>工程</strong></span><span>”和“</span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>985</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>工程</strong></span><span>”重点建设高校。</span></span><span><span><span><span>2017</span></span></span></span><span><span>年，学校进入</span><span><strong>世界一流大学</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>A</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>类建设高校</strong></span><span>行列；</span></span><span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span></span><span><span>年，入选第二轮国家“双一流”建设名单。药学院下设药物科学系和药物工程系，现已拥有</span><span><strong>药学一级学科博士点</strong></span><span>和</span><span><strong>生物与医药工程博士点</strong></span><span>。学院依托华东师范大学在药学、计算机科学、化学、生物学、软件工程、统计学、心理学等强势学科优势，围绕</span><span><strong>化学、基因、细胞、数字</strong></span><span>四类药物，重点发展</span><span><strong>人工智能药学 、药物智造、数字药物、生物药物与递送系统</strong></span><span>等前沿技术和方向，通过多学科的交叉融合，培养“全面而自由”的面向国际前沿和国家战略需求的高精尖缺“药学英才”。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>我院将在</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年暑期举办“优秀大学生夏令营活动”，</span></span><span><strong>拟招收营员</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>120</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>人（药学</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>60</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>人，生物与医药</strong></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>60</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>人）</strong></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span>即日起至</span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>17:00</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><strong><span><span>二、</span></span><span>报名条件</span></strong></p><p><span><span>优秀大学生夏令营主要面向全国高等院校（含本校）有志攻读博士、硕士研究生的优秀</span></span><span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span></span><span><span>级（拟</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年夏毕业）在校本科生。报名条件如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，遵守学术道德规范；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span><strong>药学、化学、生命科学、计算机、软件、数学、物理、机械等相关专业</strong></span><span>，学习成绩优异，本科前五学期学习成绩在其所在专业名列前茅，能够获得所在学校推荐免试资格者优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>具有一定学科背景，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的科研能力和创新能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>英语水平好，具有较强的英语听说和写作能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><br/><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>三、报名专业</span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong>申报类别</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>学位类别</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong>学制</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><strong>硕士</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学术型</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>药学（</span></span><span><span><span><span>100700</span></span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>专业型</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><strong>直博生</strong></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学术型</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>药学（</span></span><span><span><span><span>100700</span></span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><span>专业型</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>生物与医药（</span></span><span><span><span><span>086000</span></span></span></span><span><span>）（工程硕博士培养改革专项，与临港实验室联合培养）</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>直博生报考相关说明：</strong></span></span></p><p><span>直博生入学后适用博士研究生的管理规章制度，享受博士研究生的同等待遇，履行博士研究生的相关义务。本方案未尽事宜请遵照当年度博士招生章程执行。</span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span> <strong>四、报名及申请材料</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报名网站：</span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span><span>华东师范大学硕士研究生考生服务系统</span></span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjszs-ks.ecnu.edu.cn/logon?zsxm=4</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>提交材料：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span><span><span>华东师范大学优秀大学生夏令营申请表（报名系统中下载，签字盖章，扫描上传）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span><span><span>居民身份证正反面扫描件，</span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span>格式上传；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span><span><span>夏令营诚信承诺书 点击系统中文档保存下载、打印、本人签名后扫描</span></span><span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span></span><span><span>格式上传；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单，加盖申请人所在学校教务部门或院系公章，成绩单上应标明专业年级排名（扫描件）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></span><span><span>外语水平证明材料（如英语六级、托福、雅思等成绩单原件扫描件）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></span><span><span>专家推荐信</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span>封，需要副教授及以上职称专家推荐（推荐信模板，可参考：【腾讯文档】华东师范大学药学院全国优秀大学生夏令营推荐信模板</span></span><span><span><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/doc/DZWZYb1RXc1pqYXFs</span></span></span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></span><span><span>其他材料（论文发表、专利发明、各类获奖或资格证书等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span> <strong>注意事项：</strong></span></span></p><p>①<span><span><span>每位学员的申请材料必须真实，如发现申请材料有虚假成分，立即取消申请人一切资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></span></span></p><p>②<span><span><span>在系统中填写完成个人信息后，请学生依据个人实际情况，对应要求上传相关材料。无须投递邮寄纸质材料。</span></span></span></p><p> <span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span>五、<span>营员遴选</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>报名截止后，我院将根据申请者材料进行入围资格审查，入围者将在</span><span>7</span><span>月初发送通知，电子邮件通知住宿安排、活动安排，请同学们密切关注邮箱。</span></span><span>录取营员须在院系规定时间内在系统中确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃此资格。</span></p><p><span>未接到入营通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></p><p><span>优秀营员的评选规则、效力认定等另行通知。</span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>六、活动安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 夏令营活动为期</span></span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span>天，于</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>10-11</span></span></span></span><span><span>日举办，营员入选后须全程参与夏令营的各项活动。期间将安排专业介绍、参观活动、座谈交流，以了解各营员的学识、能力等情况。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span> <strong>七、支持资助</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 本次夏令营在华东师范大学闵行校区线下举办，</span><span><strong>将为营员提供夏令营期间的免费餐饮、免费住宿。</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 对于最终成为我院</span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>级研究生的营员，将提供资助报销往返火车费用（限火车硬座，高铁</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span>动车二等座，请学生开具电子发票）。</span></span></p><p><span><span> 对于家庭经济困难的同学，本人可以提出申请，经审核确认后，将提供火车交通费报销资助。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span> <strong>八、其它事项</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 未列事项参照学校相关规定执行，由药学院负责解释。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span> <strong>九、咨询方式和监督申诉渠道</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 咨询联系方式：何老师邮箱：</span></span><span><span><span><span>jiaoxue@pharm.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span><span><span>，电话</span></span><span><span><span><span>13371859379</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 咨询时间：周一至周五，</span></span><span><span><span><span>9:00-11:30,13:00-17:00</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span> 监督申诉渠道：陈老师邮箱：</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>cchen@sfs.ecnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span> 华东师范大学药学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>11</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span><strong>延伸阅读——华东师范大学药学院介绍</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span> 华东师范大学药学院于</span></span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span>月成立，聘请李洪林教授为首任院长。作为新型药学人才培养和科学研究平台，学院通过科研任务、师资力量、研究基地、招生培养方面的开放共享、深度融合，建立新的运行机制，形成新的文化氛围，努力建设成为面向国际前沿和国家战略需求的药物科学前沿基地和未来药学人才培养基地。</span><strong><span>学院现拥有</span><span>药学一级学科博士点</span><span>和</span><span>生物与医药工程两个博士点</span></strong><span>，为学科发展奠定了坚实基础。</span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/b8f8b89f-56c5-498d-be09-ed4f283ceae8.jpg\"/></p><p><span><span> 学院积极拓展社会合作，现已与包括上海药品审评核查中心、上海医药集团股份有限公司、华润医药集团有限公司、华润生物医药有限公司、睿智医药科技股份有限公司、奥锐特药业股份有限公司、上海皓元医药股份有限公司、北京赛赋医药研究院有限公司等</span><span><strong>十余家生物医药事业单位或企业签订了合作协议</strong></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/8d3977e6-a170-416b-8516-332912e498a6.jpg\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/c3afd5ab-05ea-4901-b27f-28c2cf0bc5a0.jpg\"/></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span> 在此基础上，学院已与奥锐特药业股份有限公司、上海睿智医药研究集团有限公司、上海皓元医药股份有限公司等多家</span><span><strong>上市药企签约合作共建药学联合实验室</strong></span><span>。学院还携手合作伙伴，</span><span><strong>成功打造了多个生物与医药工程硕博士实习实践基地，</strong></span><span>为学生们提供了丰富且扎实的实践基础，</span><span><strong>有力保障了学生实践锻炼与就业发展的需要</strong></span><span>。为奖励华东师大药学院学子，鼓励同学们将学习研究成果应用于企业实践，</span><span><strong>多家合作企业专门设置了奖学金，定向支持药学院的人才培养工作</strong></span><span>。</span></span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/fdcbeb8f-5f6b-44db-b869-85eaeefa5264.jpg\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/0277323b-e88f-4e59-bc0e-cb69f4d26cb4.jpg\"/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/38d65daa-867f-45d5-ace2-3238bd705b57.jpg\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pharm.ecnu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/b7/94/9c5bd01541a5963b01b0a27524b3/6c90faf8-6d04-44ac-b671-a0477d6dc54c.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"a78f8049eb57134e12f3ef7e57d27f31c87c540750c5952e55f454bc9c3afbaa","textLength":2405,"sourceSha256":"0f3c20c458e75e5fb9a68703c7236a01dff0fc55488c8f135fe4da8238fb8593","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-73ef6c1379e2677f2d65","title":"2025年华东师范大学药学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:30.549754+00:00"}
